{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VaCM1yvmhZA2PyfyUG5aLk","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"iPhone 18 Pro release date\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro Release Date: Apple’s New Flagship Could Arrive In September 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.brut.media/in/articles/iphone-18-pro-release-date-apple-s-new-flagship-could-arrive-in-september-2026\"},{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro release date: when to expect Apple's next-gen Pro powerhouses\",\"url\":\"https://www.phonearena.com/news/iphone-18-pro-release-date_id180977\"},{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro release date: When Apple is expected to reveal its new lineup\",\"url\":\"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/business/tech/iphone-18-pro-ultra-foldable-release-date-uae\"},{\"title\":\"iphone 18 release date when apples ne\",\"url\":\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/21/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-ne\"},{\"title\":\"9to5mac.com\",\"url\":\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/18/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-model-is-coming/\"},{\"title\":\"9to5mac.com\",\"url\":\"https://9to5mac.com/?p=1048598\"},{\"title\":\"9to5mac.com\",\"url\":\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/17/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-flagship-is-coming/\"},{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: Release Date and Pre-Orders - MacRumors\",\"url\":\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/10/iphone-18-pro-release-date-and-preorders/\"},{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro Release Date & What to Expect\",\"url\":\"https://smartish.com/blogs/news/iphone-18-pro-release-date\"}]\n\nApple has already announced the iPhone 18 Pro. A MacRumors article, which appears to be the most recent source, reports that pre-orders started Saturday, September 12 at 5 a.m. Pacific Time, and the phones went on sale on Friday, September 18. The initial launch countries included the U.S., Canada, the U.K., Japan, and China, and 20 other countries got the phones on September 25.\n\nEarlier pre-announcement coverage was speculative. Those reports projected a September 9 event with a September 18 release, and noted that the regular iPhone 18, iPhone 18e and possibly a second-generation iPhone Air were expected in spring 2027. Only the Pro models were expected in September. I couldn't check the MacRumors article against Apple's own newsroom, so confirm the dates on Apple's site if you need them for planning.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"999515ec-b97e-4478-9ef9-072f4dd654f5","uuid":"a31fa6c5-3d24-4e9f-9868-8cf97f3bd90d","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:47:30.494Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"iPhone 18 Pro release date","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01M7myP1BbqVqR1mXdQfyB4h","content":[{"title":"iPhone 18 Pro Release Date: Apple’s New Flagship Could Arrive In September 2026","url":"https://www.brut.media/in/articles/iphone-18-pro-release-date-apple-s-new-flagship-could-arrive-in-september-2026"},{"title":"iPhone 18 Pro release date: when to expect Apple's next-gen Pro powerhouses","url":"https://www.phonearena.com/news/iphone-18-pro-release-date_id180977"},{"title":"iPhone 18 Pro release date: When Apple is expected to reveal its new lineup","url":"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/business/tech/iphone-18-pro-ultra-foldable-release-date-uae"},{"title":"iphone 18 release date when apples ne","url":"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/21/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-ne"},{"title":"9to5mac.com","url":"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/18/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-model-is-coming/"},{"title":"9to5mac.com","url":"https://9to5mac.com/?p=1048598"},{"title":"9to5mac.com","url":"https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/17/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-flagship-is-coming/"},{"title":"iPhone 18 Pro: Release Date and Pre-Orders - MacRumors","url":"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/10/iphone-18-pro-release-date-and-preorders/"},{"title":"iPhone 18 Pro Release Date & What to Expect","url":"https://smartish.com