{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg73bexZtMCsGkyPTkDas","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"According to a MacRumors article, the iPhone 18 Pro went on sale **Friday, September 18, 2026**. Pre-orders opened Saturday, September 12. I couldn't check these dates against Apple's own site.\n\n- **Launch countries:** The U.S., Canada, the U.K., Japan and China got it first.\n- **Second wave:** About 20 other countries followed on September 25.\n- **Rest of the lineup:** Earlier reports said only the Pro models would launch in September. The standard iPhone 18, the iPhone 18e and a possible second-generation iPhone Air were expected in spring 2027.\n\nSources:\n- [MacRumors: iPhone 18 Pro Release Date and Pre-Orders](https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/10/iphone-18-pro-release-date-and-preorders/)\n- [9to5Mac: iPhone 18 release date](https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/21/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-ne)\n- [PhoneArena: iPhone 18 Pro release date](https://www.phonearena.com/news/iphone-18-pro-release-date_id180977)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1047,"cache_read_input_tokens":18610,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1047},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"999515ec-b97e-4478-9ef9-072f4dd654f5","uuid":"9fbf0628-17d6-4069-a2d8-d59748f2d7cb","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:47:33.786Z","request_id":"req_011Cg73behgw751oS7CqSqPT"}
